     1.[0m[2m **Duplicate[0m[2m processing**:[0m[2m Every single[0m[2m job is[0m[2m picked up[0m[2m by all[0m[2m 5[0m[2m workers.[0m[2m Every[0m[2m job from[0m[2m 1-[0m[2m12 is[0m[2m processed[0m[2m 5 times[0m[2m. This[0m[2m is because[0m[2m `[0m[2mdequeue[0m[2m()` has[0m[2m `[0m[2mawait asyncio[0m[2m.sleep([0m[2m0.[0m[2m01)`[0m[2m between checking[0m[2m `[0m[2mjob[0m[2m["status[0m[2m"] ==[0m[2m "pending[0m[2m"` and[0m[2m setting it[0m[2m to `"[0m[2mprocessing"[0m[2m`. During[0m[2m that[0m[2m sleep,[0m[2m other[0m[2m workers also[0m[2m find the[0m[2m same pending[0m[2m job.[0m[2m
     
